{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xp5xMGQsjk1794474927.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地版「黑色星期五」雙十一購物節，迎來第18個年頭，然而今年銷情相對平淡，民眾的消費習慣亦在改變。</p><p></p><p>自2009年11月11日開始，中國電商龍頭淘寶及其子品牌天貓，將該日宣傳為「雙十一狂歡購物節」，推出大型促銷活動，隨後其他電商紛紛加入，「雙十一」逐漸成為內地網購優惠季。</p><p></p><p>但隨著這股促銷熱潮興起，也帶來不少負面影響。過去多年，過度促銷令消費者盲目囤貨，衝動消費，加上促銷規則變得複雜，讓消費者感到麻木。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261112_QQ.SINGLES.DAY.CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h67XRMp0wT1794478660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而今年這股狂歡熱潮正在明顯降溫。有數據顯示，截至上月底，「雙十一」的總交易額剛破一萬億元人民幣，僅略高於同期。有分析認為，在青年失業率高企和房地產低迷下，民眾傾向儲蓄，選擇理性購物。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261112_QQ.SINGLES.DAY.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026X8jZ1WZQuq1794478827.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中國擁有14億人口，儘管消費者偏好和消費模式在改變，但仍然擁有龐大的消費潛力，未來或許要比較的是，誰更能精準抓住消費者的需求。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12413-%E5%A4%96%E5%8C%AF%E5%9F%BA%E9%87%91\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:23:57.168857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":366,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T14:57:31.766627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:16.547474+00:00","content_hash":"2158a98e596c8e590b148e7aa2db35f22290b9c4c387a27fdf88421809594dc0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}